                <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;flowchart LR\n\n%%========================\n%% User Layer\n%%========================\nsubgraph UL[\&quot;User Layer\&quot;]\n    USER[\&quot;👤 User\&quot;]\nend\n\n%%========================\n%% Application Layer\n%%========================\nsubgraph AL[\&quot;Application Layer\&quot;]\n    FE[\&quot;🖥️ Frontend Dashboard\&quot;]\n    BE[\&quot;⚙️ Backend Server\&quot;]\n    DB[(\&quot;🗄️ MySQL Database\&quot;)]\nend\n\n%%========================\n%% Communication Layer\n%%========================\nsubgraph CL[\&quot;Communication Layer\&quot;]\n    ESP[\&quot;📡 ESP8266 Gateway\&quot;]\nend\n\n%%========================\n%% Embedded Layer\n%%========================\nsubgraph EL[\&quot;Embedded Layer\&quot;]\n    STM[\&quot;STM32 Controller\&quot;]\n    SENSOR[\&quot;Sensor Module\&quot;]\n    RELAY[\&quot;Relay Module\&quot;]\nend\n\n%%========================\n%% Communication\n%%========================\n\nUSER &lt;--&gt;|HTTPS| FE\n\nFE &lt;--&gt;|REST API (HTTP/HTTPS)| BE\n\nBE &lt;--&gt;|SQL| DB\n\nBE &lt;--&gt;|MQTT / HTTP| ESP\n\nESP &lt;--&gt;|UART| STM\n\nSTM &lt;--&gt;|GPIO / ADC / I²C| SENSOR\n\nSTM --&gt;|GPIO Control| RELAY&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="2">
